    {
      "id": "text-80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 52,
      "text": "Trust and token boundaries",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-81",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 125,
      "y": 1005,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "A. The browser obtains a delegated access_as_user token and sends it only to the same-origin Express endpoint.\nB. Express validates the token, adds the server-held APIM subscription key, and forwards to Agent APIM.\nC. Agent APIM validates the caller, injects the fixed agent reference, and calls Foundry using the APIM managed identity.\nD. The agent direct MCP tool uses the Foundry project managed identity; MCP APIM validates it and calls Azure MCP using APIM managed identity.\nE. Azure MCP uses its Container App managed identity, so every caller receives the same Azure RBAC scope.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "A. The browser obtains a delegated access_as_user token and sends it only to the same-origin Express endpoint.\nB. Express validates the token, adds the server-held APIM subscription key, and forwards to Agent APIM.\nC. Agent APIM validates the caller, injects the fixed agent reference, and calls Foundry using the APIM managed identity.\nD. The agent direct MCP tool uses the Foundry project managed identity; MCP APIM validates it and calls Azure MCP using APIM managed identity.\nE. Azure MCP uses its Container App managed identity, so every caller receives the same Azure RBAC scope."
    },
    {
      "id": "text-82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1165,
      "width": 1760,
      "height": 38,
      "text": "Solid arrows = runtime calls   |   Dashed purple arrows = token issuance / identity relationship   |   No client secrets required",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "Solid arrows = runtime calls   |   Dashed purple arrows = token issuance / identity relationship   |   No client secrets required"
    },
